Frequently Asked Questions

Do you handle outdoor weddings? Yes, our tents and lighting packages are designed for outdoor use, including gardens, farms, and open venues. We recommend booking the tent package for any outdoor event in case of weather.

Can I rent items individually instead of a full package? Yes, every item can be rented separately, though full packages offer a better combined rate.

Do you offer setup and breakdown? Yes, setup and breakdown are included in every rental at no extra charge, as long as the venue is accessible for our delivery vehicle.

What happens if it rains during an outdoor event? Our tents are weatherproof, but we recommend having a backup indoor space for safety in severe weather. We are not liable for weather-related event changes.

Do you require a minimum guest count? No, we work with events of any size, from small gatherings to large functions.

Is wheelchair accessible setup available? Yes, we can accommodate accessibility needs such as wider walkways between tables and ramp-friendly tent placement. Please mention this when booking so we can plan the layout.

How far in advance should I book? We recommend booking at least 3 to 4 weeks in advance for weddings and there at least 1 week for smaller gatherings.
